   "text": "web/utils/bookingSource.ts  SOURCES = [instagram, google, whatsapp]; else 'website'\napi/routes/public/reservations.ts  same enum, kept in sync by hand\nweb/pages/admin/index.vue  source filter lists website, instagram, google, whatsapp,\n                           walk_in, phone, host\n\nShare these links:\n  https://<site>/bali?src=instagram     -> put in Instagram bio\n  https://<site>/bali?src=whatsapp      -> put in WhatsApp profile / broadcast\n  https://<site>/bali                   -> website (default)",
   "originalText": "web/utils/bookingSource.ts  SOURCES = [instagram, google, whatsapp]; else 'website'\napi/routes/public/reservations.ts  same enum, kept in sync by hand\nweb/pages/admin/index.vue  source filter lists website, instagram, google, whatsapp,\n                           walk_in, phone, host\n\nShare these links:\n  https://<site>/bali?src=instagram     -> put in Instagram bio\n  https://<site>/bali?src=whatsapp      -> put in WhatsApp profile / broadcast\n  https://<site>/bali                   -> website (default)",
